{"id":"psikh","lemma":"псих","pos":"noun","rank":1294,"glosses":["psycho, lunatic, psychopath (a person who is psychotic or otherwise insane).","nut (a person who acts in a bizarre or dangerous manner)","state of being angry; madness; being in a rash (often used when speaking about children)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f7/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%81%D0%B8%D1%85.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%81%D0%B8%D1%85.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"психа","plural":"психи"},"examples":[{"text":"Думаешь, я псих?","en":"Do you think I'm crazy?","words":[{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"I"},null]},{"text":"Мы оба психи.","en":"We're both crazy.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"both"},null]},{"text":"Я думаю, ты псих.","en":"I think you're nuts.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"you"},null]},{"text":"Какой псих будет такое говорить?","en":"What kind of a madman would say something like that?","words":[{"g":"what, what one"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},{"g":"something like that"},{"g":"to speak, to talk"}]},{"text":"Он полный псих.","en":"He's completely crazy.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"full, complete"},null]}]}